g general student hours","subtitle":"Kesler Student Activities Center","notes":"Check the current select-hour schedule, then meet for general pool use. Plan around athletic training and class activity, which also use the facility.","short_summary":"A two-lane lap pool that Taylor opens for general student use at select times.","evidence_claim":"Taylor says the Eichling Aquatics Wing pool is open for general student use during select hours and that athletic-facility space is free to students.","source_url":"https://www.taylor.edu/life-at-taylor/facilities/athletic-fitness-locations","source_title":"Athletic & Fitness Locations | Taylor University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General student pool hours vary throughout the year; contact Taylor’s listed KSAC contact for current availability.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"memorial-prayer-chapel","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Memorial Prayer Chapel","title":"Pause at Memorial Prayer Chapel","subtitle":"Central campus, between academic and residential buildings","notes":"Gather quietly with a small group in the chapel, then leave room for others seeking reflection. The building also has two private prayer rooms and outdoor alcoves.","short_summary":"A campus chapel purpose-built for prayer, with space for a residence-hall group.","evidence_claim":"Taylor describes Memorial Prayer Chapel as created specifically for prayer, with a 75-seat chapel, private prayer rooms, and outdoor alcoves.","source_url":"https://www.taylor.edu/life-at-taylor/facilities/gathering-performance-spaces","source_title":"Gathering & Performance Spaces | Taylor University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use this as a quiet, reflective space and respect private rooms and other visitors.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rediger-chapel-service","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Taylor Chapel at Rediger Chapel & Auditorium","title":"Attend a Taylor chapel service","subtitle":"LaRita Boren Campus Center","notes":"Meet before the 10 a.m. service, sit together in Rediger, and stay afterward to compare reflections. Services include student-led worship and speakers.","short_summary":"A recurring campus worship gathering in Rediger Chapel & Auditorium.","evidence_claim":"Taylor states that chapel convenes Monday, Wednesday, and Friday at 10 a.m. in Rediger Auditorium and that attendance is not monitored.","source_url":"https://www.taylor.edu/life-at-taylor/spiritual-development/chapel","source_title":"Chapel | Taylor University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular chapel is Monday, Wednesday, and Friday at 10 a.m. in the LaRita Boren Student Center; campus schedules can change.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
