ate rooms and other visitors.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rediger-chapel-service","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Taylor Chapel at Rediger Chapel & Auditorium","title":"Attend a Taylor chapel service","subtitle":"LaRita Boren Campus Center","notes":"Meet before the 10 a.m. service, sit together in Rediger, and stay afterward to compare reflections. Services include student-led worship and speakers.","short_summary":"A recurring campus worship gathering in Rediger Chapel & Auditorium.","evidence_claim":"Taylor states that chapel convenes Monday, Wednesday, and Friday at 10 a.m. in Rediger Auditorium and that attendance is not monitored.","source_url":"https://www.taylor.edu/life-at-taylor/spiritual-development/chapel","source_title":"Chapel | Taylor University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular chapel is Monday, Wednesday, and Friday at 10 a.m. in the LaRita Boren Student Center; campus schedules can change.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
